  "solution": {
    "text": "Find <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> due to each arc at <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> and add them using vector addition.<br /><br />Since magnetic field at the centre of an arc is equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">µ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>πr</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></math><br /><br />hence, net <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">µ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">µ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>iθ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>24</mn><mi>πR</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>"
